{"version":"2026-10-27T14-15-07-832Z","schemaVersion":1,"publishedAt":"2026-10-27T14:15:07.832Z","worlds":[{"id":"astrath-deeprealm","name":"Astrath Deeprealm","defaultMapId":"astrath-deeprealm-overview","credits":{"badges":true,"page":true}}],"maps":[{"id":"astrath-deeprealm-overview","worldId":"astrath-deeprealm","name":"Overview","width":200000,"height":150000,"oceanColor":"#18313f","soundscape":{"areas":[{"id":"area-0","visibility":"player","points":[[-20000,-20000],[220000,-20000],[220000,170000],[-20000,170000]],"bed":{"src":"atlas/assets/audio/ce5af482.ogg","srcFallback":"atlas/assets/audio/82635d4e.m4a","gain":0.5}},{"id":"area-1","visibility":"player","points":[[155000,5000],[201000,5000],[201000,45000],[155000,45000]],"bed":{"src":"atlas/assets/audio/33a29b91.ogg","srcFallback":"atlas/assets/audio/e36223af.m4a","gain":0.6}},{"id":"area-2","visibility":"player","points":[[8000,80000],[36000,80000],[36000,104000],[8000,104000]],"bed":{"src":"atlas/assets/audio/003bd929.ogg","srcFallback":"atlas/assets/audio/eda0f382.m4a","gain":0.55}}]},"wrapX":false,"scale":{"unitsPerPixel":0.05,"unitLabel":"mi"},"grid":{"kind":"hex","size":5000,"color":"rgba(255,255,255,0.06)","enabled":false},"layers":[{"id":"upload-1778790358938-0-chatgpt-image-may-4-2026","src":"atlas/assets/maps/chatgpt-image-may-4-2026-09_15_31-pm-4-.png","x":100000,"y":0,"width":31250,"height":15625,"opacity":1,"zIndex":20},{"id":"upload-1778790368852-0-chatgpt-image-may-4-2026","src":"atlas/assets/maps/chatgpt-image-may-4-2026-09_15_32-pm-5-.png","x":10000,"y":83000,"width":24700,"height":18544,"opacity":1,"zIndex":20},{"id":"upload-1778790373361-0-chatgpt-image-may-4-2026","src":"atlas/assets/maps/chatgpt-image-may-4-2026-09_15_32-pm-6-.png","x":5000,"y":40000,"width":37116,"height":27842,"opacity":1,"zIndex":20},{"id":"upload-1778790377488-0-chatgpt-image-may-4-2026","src":"atlas/assets/maps/chatgpt-image-may-4-2026-09_15_30-pm-1-.png","x":159276,"y":9457,"width":41756,"height":31322,"opacity":1,"zIndex":20},{"id":"upload-1778790382442-0-chatgpt-image-may-4-2026","src":"atlas/assets/maps/chatgpt-image-may-4-2026-09_15_30-pm-2-.png","x":140000,"y":60000,"width":55050,"height":41294,"opacity":1,"zIndex":20},{"id":"upload-1778790407722-0-chatgpt-image-may-4-2026","src":"atlas/assets/maps/chatgpt-image-may-4-2026-09_15_31-pm-3-.png","x":77981,"y":33482,"width":61930,"height":46458,"opacity":1,"zIndex":20}],"regions":[],"routes":[]}],"entities":[{"id":"fall-of-the-old-keep","title":"Fall of the Old Keep","type":"event","world":"astrath-deeprealm","visibility":"player","canon":"canon","aliases":[],"tags":["calamity","ruins"],"summary":"The Old Keep falls in a single night to a shadow that came down from the high passes.","images":[],"body":"\nOn the third night of Longnight, 612 AS, the watchfires of the [[The Old Keep|Old Keep]]\nwent dark. Riders from [[Raven's Vale]] found the gates open and the courtyards\nempty by morning. Whatever passed that night left no bodies, only frost.\n\nThe keep has stood abandoned ever since.\n","bodyHtml":"<p>On the third night of Longnight, 612 AS, the watchfires of the <span class=\"atlas-planned-link-player\">Old Keep</span><br>went dark. Riders from <span class=\"atlas-planned-link-player\">Raven's Vale</span> found the gates open and the courtyards<br>empty by morning. Whatever passed that night left no bodies, only frost.</p>\n<p>The keep has stood abandoned ever since.</p>\n","frontmatter":{},"sourcePath":"","links":[{"target":"The Old Keep","display":"Old Keep","broken":true},{"target":"Raven's Vale","display":"Raven's Vale","broken":true}],"backlinks":[],"dateRaw":"612, month 6, day 3","dateValue":223533,"dateYear":612},{"id":"founding-of-thornhold","title":"Founding of Thornhold","type":"event","world":"astrath-deeprealm","visibility":"player","canon":"canon","aliases":[],"tags":["founding","thornhold"],"summary":"Lord Garron raises the red walls of Thornhold above the iron veins of the Spinegrey range.","images":[],"body":"\nForty-seven years after the [[The Sundering|Sundering]], settlers from the eastern\nports broke the first stones of [[Thornhold]] from the cliffside. The\nfoundation feast lasted nine days, ending with the lighting of the Forge of\nGarron — still tended today.\n","bodyHtml":"<p>Forty-seven years after the <a class=\"atlas-wikilink\" data-entity-id=\"the-sundering\" href=\"#/entity/the-sundering\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\">Sundering</a>, settlers from the eastern<br>ports broke the first stones of <span class=\"atlas-planned-link-player\">Thornhold</span> from the cliffside. The<br>foundation feast lasted nine days, ending with the lighting of the Forge of<br>Garron — still tended today.</p>\n","frontmatter":{},"sourcePath":"","links":[{"target":"The Sundering","display":"Sundering","resolvedId":"the-sundering","broken":false},{"target":"Thornhold","display":"Thornhold","broken":true}],"backlinks":[],"dateRaw":"47, month 3, day 12","dateValue":17227,"dateYear":47},{"id":"the-sundering","title":"The Sundering","type":"event","world":"astrath-deeprealm","visibility":"player","canon":"canon","aliases":[],"tags":["cataclysm","founding"],"summary":"The cataclysm that split the old continent and ended the Third Age. The new calendar reckons years from the day the sky cracked.","images":[],"body":"\nWhen the Twin Moons collided in the night sky, the firmament tore and the seas\nboiled. Half of the old continent slid beneath the waves; what remained\nbecame the Astrath Deeprealm. Survivors founded the great cities of\n[[Thornhold]] and [[Sunhaven]] in the years that followed.\n\nThis event marks year **0** of the *After Sundering* calendar.\n","bodyHtml":"<p>When the Twin Moons collided in the night sky, the firmament tore and the seas<br>boiled. Half of the old continent slid beneath the waves; what remained<br>became the Astrath Deeprealm. Survivors founded the great cities of<br><span class=\"atlas-planned-link-player\">Thornhold</span> and <span class=\"atlas-planned-link-player\">Sunhaven</span> in the years that followed.</p>\n<p>This event marks year <strong>0</strong> of the <em>After Sundering</em> calendar.</p>\n","frontmatter":{},"sourcePath":"","links":[{"target":"Thornhold","display":"Thornhold","broken":true},{"target":"Sunhaven","display":"Sunhaven","broken":true}],"backlinks":[{"id":"founding-of-thornhold","title":"Founding of Thornhold"}],"dateRaw":"0, month 1, day 1","dateValue":1,"dateYear":0}],"placements":[{"id":"fall-of-the-old-keep@astrath-deeprealm-overview","entityId":"fall-of-the-old-keep","mapId":"astrath-deeprealm-overview","x":100480,"y":71464,"label":"Fall of the Old Keep","visibility":"player"},{"id":"founding-of-thornhold@astrath-deeprealm-overview","entityId":"founding-of-thornhold","mapId":"astrath-deeprealm-overview","x":113984,"y":68649,"label":"Founding of Thornhold","visibility":"player"},{"id":"the-sundering@astrath-deeprealm-overview","entityId":"the-sundering","mapId":"astrath-deeprealm-overview","x":105536,"y":60453,"label":"The Sundering","visibility":"player"}],"assets":[{"id":"asset-0","src":"atlas/assets/maps/chatgpt-image-may-4-2026-09_15_31-pm-4-.png","type":"image"},{"id":"asset-1","src":"atlas/assets/maps/chatgpt-image-may-4-2026-09_15_32-pm-5-.png","type":"image"},{"id":"asset-2","src":"atlas/assets/maps/chatgpt-image-may-4-2026-09_15_32-pm-6-.png","type":"image"},{"id":"asset-3","src":"atlas/assets/maps/chatgpt-image-may-4-2026-09_15_30-pm-1-.png","type":"image"},{"id":"asset-4","src":"atlas/assets/maps/chatgpt-image-may-4-2026-09_15_30-pm-2-.png","type":"image"},{"id":"asset-5","src":"atlas/assets/maps/chatgpt-image-may-4-2026-09_15_31-pm-3-.png","type":"image"}],"buildReport":{"scanned":7,"included":3,"excluded":4,"warnings":[],"brokenLinks":5,"unresolvedLinks":5,"duplicateSlugs":0,"strippedDmBlocks":0,"localAssets":6,"externalAssets":0,"missingAssets":0}}